==============================================================================
restricted join (PS (x) PS)|omega_3> = sqrt(2/3) |omega_2> on S (x) S: defect 1.6e-16
transport     max|T r Z22|,|Z22 T r|  T r |omega_3> = 0  letter support of the 12 qubit-only records
T_b0(R,L)                    0.0e+00                  6  {'in S (rank 2)': 9, 'reaches |2> (rank 3)': 3}  reaching |2>: {'comm': 3}
T_b0(L,R)                    0.0e+00                  6  {'in S (rank 2)': 9, 'reaches |2> (rank 3)': 3}  reaching |2>: {'comm': 3}
T_b0(S,S)                    0.0e+00                  6  {'in S (rank 2)': 9, 'reaches |2> (rank 3)': 3}  reaching |2>: {'comm': 3}
T_b1(R,L)                    0.0e+00                  6  {'in S (rank 2)': 12}
