T_b1(S,S)                    0.0e+00                  6  {'in S (rank 2)': 12}
  (with b = 0 the identity left at the other copy becomes PS, whose traceless part (prop. to lambda_8) reaches |2>; the letters themselves are t(sigma) on S)
T_b1(R,L): qubit-only records whose image annihilates the join, T r |omega_3> = 0: {(np.str_('evsame'), np.str_('qq')): 3, (np.str_('comm'), np.str_('comm')): 3} (E'-odd single-slot sums and anticommuting pairs, by the transpose identity)
native QQ records for comparison: letter supports under H: {'in S (rank 2)': 9, 'reaches |2> (rank 3)': 47, 'reaches |2> (rank 2)': 8} ; annihilating the join: 8 (the Letter gives every E'-even QQ record sqrt3 regardless)
smallest invariant projector containing the support S of a transported letter: under H it is PS (rank 2), under SU(3) it is 1 (rank 3)
joint state: ||Omega|| = 1.000000000000; its q1q2 marginal is pure (largest eigenvalue 1.000000000000), a qubit pair
amplitude summed over matched directions, a = Tr(P C_omega):
   J1 = Tr(1_3 . 1_3/sqrt3) = 1.732050807569 = sqrt3   (rank-3 projector: the join's three directions)
   J2 = Tr(PS  . 1_3/sqrt3) = 1.154700538379 = 2/sqrt3 (minimal H-invariant support: two of the join's strands)
   J3 = Tr C of the restricted join renormalized, |omega_2> on S (x) S = 1.414213562373 = sqrt2
   J4 = Tr C of the q1q2 pair reached through link-join-link in the joint state = 1.414213562373 = sqrt2

